{"municipality_code":"06361","pref":"山形県","city":"金山町","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"金山町には、田茂沢村、安沢村、下野明村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には城跡や陣屋跡、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「金山城跡」、「本町遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、田茂沢村や安沢村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では岸宏一に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「楯山城址」や「栗駒国定公園」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":32,"rank":1008,"percentile":46.3,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":3,"rank":1872,"percentile":0.5,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":2,"rank":320,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":12,"rank":1062,"percentile":42.1,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["岸宏一"],"tourism_landmarks":["楯山城址","栗駒国定公園","